@startuml
title ClinicBook - Use case diagram (Week 6, Dajana Bardhi)

' Scope of this model: doctor availability and booking (FR-02..FR-05, FR-09,
' FR-16, FR-17). The other use cases are shown to keep the system boundary
' of Option A complete for the team.

left to right direction
skinparam usecaseFontSize 12
skinparam noteFontSize 11

actor "Patient" as Patient
actor "Receptionist" as Receptionist
actor "Doctor" as Doctor
actor "Clinic manager" as Manager
actor "Clock / timer\n(system actor)" as Clock

rectangle "ClinicBook" {
  usecase "UC-01\nRegister patient\n(FR-01)" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02\nSee free slots\n(FR-02)" as UC02
  usecase "UC-03\nBook a free slot\n(FR-03)" as UC03
  usecase "UC-04\nBook for a patient\n(FR-03, FR-05)" as UC04
  usecase "UC-05\nApply booking rules\n(FR-04, FR-05, FR-09, FR-17)" as UC05
  usecase "UC-06\nReschedule a booking\n(FR-16)" as UC06
  usecase "UC-07\nCancel an appointment\n(FR-06)" as UC07
  usecase "UC-08\nView daily schedule\n(FR-07)" as UC08
  usecase "UC-09\nMark attended / no-show\n(FR-08)" as UC09
  usecase "UC-10\nBlock a period\n(FR-10)" as UC10
  usecase "UC-11\nSend reminder\n(FR-11)" as UC11
  usecase "UC-12\nMonthly report\n(FR-12)" as UC12
}

Patient --> UC02
Patient --> UC03
Patient --> UC06
Patient --> UC07

Receptionist --> UC01
Receptionist --> UC02
Receptionist --> UC04
Receptionist --> UC07
Receptionist --> UC09

Doctor --> UC08
Doctor --> UC10
Manager --> UC12
Clock --> UC11

UC03 ..> UC02 : <<include>>
UC04 ..> UC02 : <<include>>
UC06 ..> UC02 : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UC05 : <<include>>
UC04 ..> UC05 : <<include>>
UC06 ..> UC05 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC09
  Feeds the no-show count used
  by UC-05 (FR-09).
end note

note right of UC05
  Rules are checked in order; the first failure wins:
  clinic hours, future, not blocked;
  slot free (FR-04);
  &lt; 2 future bookings (FR-05);
  no overlap for the patient (FR-17);
  &lt; 3 no-shows in 90 days online (FR-09).
end note

note bottom of UC07
  Patient: up to 24 h before the slot,
  and only their own appointment.
  Receptionist: also within 24 h; booked only (FR-06).
end note

@enduml
